  [Prop 2.6] remainder supported in [-a,a]: beats the frontier only if a > 0.98661  (using bandwidth-one ceiling 0.6818287); height gain factor 1/a < 1.0136
  [Prop 2.6] remainder supported in [-a,a]: beats the frontier only if a > 0.99051  (using LP value (NUMERICAL)); height gain factor 1/a < 1.0096

