Part 3: Theorem H1 -- (**) for arbitrary real atoms plus ONE conjugate pair (any multiplicity m, any height v)
  identity: Sigma - cost = sum_j (W_j^2 - cost_j) + sum_{j!=k} W_j W_k r(x_j-x_k) + 4m sum_j W_j G_v(x_j) + 4m^2 X(v) + 4m(m-1) + int shat |S_0|^2,
  G_v = r + Q_v, Q_v = FT[rho (cosh(2 pi a v) - 1)], X(v) = int rho sinh^2(2 pi a v).  Cell packing: per cell of diameter d,
